  "description": "GemBox.Imaging is a .NET component that enables you to read, convert, and transform image files (PNG, JPEG, and GIF) from .NET applications.\n      With GemBox.Imaging you get a fast and reliable component that's easy to use and doesn't depend on Microsoft Windows GDI. It requires only .NET so you can deploy your applications on any platform.",
